## Task 2: the concat difflist decoder + gate flip (GREEN)

**Files:**
- Modify: `src/pgen_concat_reader.hpp` — new method decl + per-`Member` sparse scratch.
- Modify: `src/pgen_concat_reader.cpp` — `GetDifflistOrGenovec` implementation.
- Modify: `src/pfile_reader.cpp` — drop `!IsConcat()` at `:3936`; wire the concat branch
  into the sparse Phase-1 scan (~5460–5528) so a concat read calls the new method and
  feeds the existing carrier switch; set the concat proof-ran read-back.

**Interfaces:**
- Consumes: Task 1's proof-ran read-back; the `.test` fixtures and `EXCEPT` harness.
- Produces: `ConcatPgenReader::GetDifflistOrGenovec(uint32_t vidx, <combined carrier
  out>)` returning a combined list of `(combined_sample_idx, genotype)` for every
  non-hom_ref sample (spec §4.2). Caller passes no `si_ptr`/`pssi`.

- [ ] **Step 1 — the reader method (spec §4.2, §5).** Add per-`Member` raregeno +
  difflist-ids scratch via `EnsureScratch`, sized to `m.out_ct`. Combined output sized to
  `OutputSampleCt()`. Per shard: `PgrGetDifflistOrGenovec` with `m.SampleInclude()` /
  `m.pssi` / `m.out_ct` and per-shard threshold `max(1, m.out_ct/8)`; hom_ref-major →
  append carriers at `m.out_offset + s`; dense / ALT-major → re-decode with **`m`'s**
  reader (NOT lstate) and append non-zero samples. Emit `g==3`.
- [ ] **Step 2 — gate flip + scan wiring.** At `:3936` drop `!bind_data.IsConcat()`. In
  the Phase-1 scan, when `lstate.concat && smp_use_sparse`, call the new method and run
  the existing carrier switch over the combined list; bump the concat proof-ran read-back
  by the decoded-variant count. Keep the single-file path unchanged.
- [ ] **Step 3 — add F2's mixed-case assertions** (if not fully present): one variant
  `> out_ct/8` carriers in a shard (dense genovec, `common_geno==UINT32_MAX`), one ~95%
  hom_alt in a shard (ALT-major difflist, `common_geno==2`), each with the fixture-guard.
- [ ] **Step 4 — `make format-fix`, build (Slurm), run the suite.** Expected: ALL
  fixtures' per-sample `EXCEPT` empty (both directions); the concat negative control
  read-back `> 0` under sparse, `0` under dense; the single-file proof still passes; the
  full suite green. Read the suite tail; record counts.
- [ ] **Step 5 — commit** (exclude `third_party/plink-ng`).

